== Description ==

ERA Clock plugin easy plugin to dispaly the clock anywhere in your wordpress website.

There are a lot of benefits from using ERA Clock reviews:

*   Easy to use.
*   SEO friendly.
*   100% Responsive Layout with Bootstrap.
*   Support WP Bakery / Visual composer Page Builder.
*   Support Elementor Page Builder.
*   Review Elementor Widget support.
*   Easy to Customize.
*   Supported Online Documentation.

**Easy To Use**

Use this ShortCode " [era_clock fontsize = 50px backcolor = green bordercolor = red textcolor =white] "

**fontsize** select clock font size that matches your layout
**backcolor** select clock back gorund color that matches your layout
**bordercolor** select clock border color that matches your layout
**textcolor** select clock text color that matches your layout


Simply you can test it using our <a href="https://plugins.era-solutions.com/#Demo"> **Demo Link**  </a>


== Installation ==

1. Upload the plugin files to the /wp-content/plugins directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.

2. Activate the plugin through the ‘Plugins’ screen in WordPress.

3. Use the ERA Clock->Settings screen to configure the plugin.



